{
  "name": "TrOCR Inference Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TrOCR Inference Pipeline\n1. Form or API POSTs JSON to this webhook\n2. Inference API is called at /inference/start\n3. Status is polled every 30s\n4. Email sent on success/failure\n\nThe inference service reads from HuggingFace and pushes output itself.",
